        "slc_a86f3fecd8cc7f2ca4a74bd50db327b54cfd564b2604efbab63fa28f937330ce"
      ],
      "text": "Local infrastructure runs RabbitMQ and Postgres via Docker Compose, and GitHub webhooks are proxied to the local server through smee.io."
    },
